# BIOBUZZ field element from FIRST's official field CAD (Onshape export), decimated.
# FTC field frame: inches, origin at the field centre on the tile top, +x toward the audience,
# +y from the red wall toward the blue wall, z up. No normals: let the importer calculate them.
